%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e9620f8c34305754d8cc9a7e49e852d9, type: 3}
  m_Name: NPCDialogue_en
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  m_LocaleId:
    m_Code: en
  m_SharedData: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 0f91960a2d90aa5468602ee1b60721d5, type: 2}
  m_Metadata:
    m_Items: []
  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 104222408704
    m_Localized: Next
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104302100480
    m_Localized: Miso
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294784
    m_Localized: "Oh, so you're (\uD50C\uB808\uC774\uC5B4 \uC774\uB984), the new
      tea shop owner!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294785
    m_Localized: 'We finally get to introduce ourselves properly!

      I''m Miso.

      I
      have a feeling we''ll be seeing each other a lot,

      so let''s be friends!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294786
    m_Localized: It's nice to meet you too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294787
    m_Localized: Nice to meet you, Miso.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294788
    m_Localized: 'Hehe, great!

      From now on, whenever you''re bored,

      I''ll
      be the very first one to come talk to you!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294789
    m_Localized: 'Mm-hmm, nice to meet you!

      I''ll bring lots of even better
      stories next time,

      so you can look forward to it!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294790
    m_Localized: "Oh, (\uD50C\uB808\uC774\uC5B4 \uC774\uB984), you're here!\nPerfect
      timing\u2014I was just getting bored."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294791
    m_Localized: 'You''re back!

      So, what should we talk about first today?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294792
    m_Localized: 'Hehe. Whenever you show up, even the air outside the shop

      feels
      a little more exciting.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294793
    m_Localized: Everyday life
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294794
    m_Localized: The other rabbits
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294795
    m_Localized: The old days
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294796
    m_Localized: Hasn't the village been way too quiet lately?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294797
    m_Localized: Ever since the Moon Tree's light weakened, it feels like everyone's
      started speaking more quietly too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294798
    m_Localized: Maybe if you keep us entertained...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294799
    m_Localized: A little peace and quiet isn't so bad.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294800
    m_Localized: Hehe, right? I knew you'd agree!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294801
    m_Localized: Then don't worry! Until the tree shines again, I'll keep this village
      lively all by myself!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294802
    m_Localized: Aw, but if it's quiet all the time, things get boring!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294803
    m_Localized: Sometimes you need a big burst of laughter to make the village feel
      alive!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294804
    m_Localized: I wonder which sweets the alien guests like best.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294805
    m_Localized: 'Soft, chewy rice cakes? Crispy cookies?

      Or maybe something
      that sparkles just by looking at it?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294806
    m_Localized: We'll know once they try them.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294807
    m_Localized: Which sweets do you like best, Miso?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294808
    m_Localized: Right! If we watch their faces closely, we'll figure it out in no
      time.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294809
    m_Localized: Do aliens' eyes sparkle when they eat something delicious too?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294810
    m_Localized: I like things that are sweet and chewy!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294811
    m_Localized: You know, the kind that cheers you up in one bite! I bet the aliens
      would love treats like that too!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294812
    m_Localized: "Hey, (\uD50C\uB808\uC774\uC5B4 \uC774\uB984). Did you see the Moon
      Tree too?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294813
    m_Localized: 'It looked like something was flowing through the leaves,

      and
      I swear it was shimmering more than before!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294814
    m_Localized: I saw it too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294815
    m_Localized: Right? So I wasn't imagining it!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294816
    m_Localized: Even the whole village feels a little brighter than usual!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294817
    m_Localized: ...Or am I imagining that part?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294818
    m_Localized: 'Did you hear?

      That chubby rabbit from the lower village
      says

      he''s going on a diet and only eating carrot roots!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294819
    m_Localized: 'But last night, I saw him secretly buying

      a whole bunch
      of warmed-up honey tteok.

      Isn''t that hilarious?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294820
    m_Localized: Wow, impressive.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294821
    m_Localized: News travels fast with you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294822
    m_Localized: 'Right?

      There really is no such thing as a secret!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294823
    m_Localized: 'If he comes to our shop later,

      pretend you know nothing
      and give him a free honey tteok.

      He''ll be so shocked! Hahaha!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294824
    m_Localized: "Hehe, I'm the neighborhood news expert!\nMy ears are magical\u2014they
      soak up\nevery bit of gossip in the village."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294825
    m_Localized: 'If there''s ever anything you want to know,

      just ask me,
      Boss!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294826
    m_Localized: 'You know,

      I don''t even know where this place called Korea
      is on Earth,

      so when you said you were opening a shop for its snacks,
      I thought you were really unusual!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294827
    m_Localized: Our ancestors made rice cakes too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294828
    m_Localized: 'Well, that''s true!

      Rice cakes are a staple for us moon
      rabbits...

      But I never knew you could turn them into such pretty sweets.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294829
    m_Localized: Anyway, it still makes you seem like someone from another world.
      It's so fascinating!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294830
    m_Localized: 'Did you see Maru just now?

      He stood there polishing his
      glasses for thirty whole minutes today.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294831
    m_Localized: "I nagged him a little, and then he started lecturing me again\nabout
      \u201Cthe refractive index of spectacle lenses\u201D or whatever!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294832
    m_Localized: Seriously, take studying away and there's nothing left of him!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294833
    m_Localized: Maru is smart, though.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294834
    m_Localized: You two seem close.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294835
    m_Localized: 'Smart, my foot!

      Once, he was calculating when to harvest
      a sweet pumpkin

      and dropped it right on his own foot.

      He can
      be such an idiot sometimes!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294836
    m_Localized: 'Still...

      I guess he does look kind of serious

      when
      he''s polishing those glasses.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294837
    m_Localized: 'Close? No way! Ugh, you''re giving me chills!

      We just grew
      up together, so I have no choice but to look after him.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294838
    m_Localized: 'Ahem, you know what it was like.

      Even when the three of
      us played in the dirt as kids,

      he''d be off polishing his glasses by
      himself.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294839
    m_Localized: 'Oh, there I go talking about the old days again.

      Okay, stop
      looking at me like that. Next topic!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294840
    m_Localized: 'Did you know?

      When I was born, there wasn''t even a boundary
      between day and night.

      They say daytime only appeared after the Star
      Lamp was invented.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294841
    m_Localized: 'You know, that huuuge star-shaped machine

      all the way over
      by the village entrance.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294842
    m_Localized: There was no daytime at all?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294843
    m_Localized: It does seem to make life easier.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294844
    m_Localized: 'I''m serious!

      Back in our parents'' generation, it was always
      dark and dim.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294845
    m_Localized: 'Exactly! We owe it all to those engineer rabbits!

      I don''t
      know how our parents lived without any light.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294846
    m_Localized: 'Isn''t Aunt Somi from the mill

      just bursting with energy?

      The
      second she saw me today,

      she started yelling that I needed to eat proper
      meals!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294847
    m_Localized: 'And right beside her, Uncle Garam

      just kept pounding away
      in silence.

      They''re such a strange combination, aren''t they?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294848
    m_Localized: They really suit each other.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294849
    m_Localized: Garam scares me.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294850
    m_Localized: 'Right! Whenever Aunt Somi bursts out laughing,

      the corner
      of Uncle Garam''s mouth lifts just a tiny bit.

      I thought I was the only
      one who noticed!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294851
    m_Localized: 'They''re so different, but it''s lovely

      watching them take
      care of each other.

      Our dear shopkeeper ought to find

      a partner
      like that someday too!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294852
    m_Localized: 'Puhaha!

      Uncle Garam is pretty blunt, isn''t he?

      But
      did you know this?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294853
    m_Localized: 'When you first said you were opening the tea shop,

      Uncle
      Garam asked Aunt Somi

      to find you good, hot-burning firewood

      so
      you wouldn''t burn your hands.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294854
    m_Localized: 'Don''t be scared.

      Uncle Garam is just bad at showing how
      he feels!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294855
    m_Localized: 'Whoa, the village is definitely way brighter than before!

      It
      practically looks like light is pouring out of the tree!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294856
    m_Localized: Really? I can't tell.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294857
    m_Localized: You're right. It is.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294858
    m_Localized: 'I''m serious!

      I mean, we already have the Star Lamp,

      so
      I don''t literally mean the village is brighter...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294859
    m_Localized: It's a metaphor! A metaphorical expression! Hehe.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294860
    m_Localized: Right? Seeing the village come alive thanks to you puts me in a
      great mood too!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294861
    m_Localized: 'I was cleaning out the storage room earlier and found an old toy.
      Do you remember it?

      That little spaceship toy

      we played with
      when we were kids.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294862
    m_Localized: ...I don't remember.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294863
    m_Localized: ...I hate spaceships.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294864
    m_Localized: 'Oh... I''m sorry.

      I brought it up without thinking again.

      After
      that day, even the sound of a spaceship

      used to make you tremble...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294865
    m_Localized: 'I thought we''d thrown all of them away,

      but I guess I still
      had one. Just forget I said anything.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294866
    m_Localized: 'You know how aliens use

      those sparkling pieces of Starlight
      as money?

      The more I think about it, the stranger it seems!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294867
    m_Localized: I heard they carve them from meteors.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294868
    m_Localized: 'That''s right!

      They carve up meteor fragments that fell
      onto planets

      and leftover bits of Starlight drifting through space,

      then
      use them as currency. Isn''t that amazing?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294869
    m_Localized: 'The moonlight was gorgeous last night.

      Did you go out for
      a walk?

      I passed your shop, and the lights were still on.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294870
    m_Localized: I was practicing.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294871
    m_Localized: I couldn't sleep.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294872
    m_Localized: 'I get it. Everything gets so quiet at night,

      and then your
      thoughts start piling up, right?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294873
    m_Localized: 'After what happened,

      you couldn''t sleep properly for a
      long time.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294874
    m_Localized: 'When I remember those days,

      I''m so glad you look strong
      and cheerful now.

      You''d better get a good night''s sleep tonight, okay?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294875
    m_Localized: 'I bought a bunch of handkerchiefs recently,

      and I brought
      one for you too!

      What color do you like?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294876
    m_Localized: Anything but red should be fine.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294877
    m_Localized: I'd like blue or green.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294878
    m_Localized: 'Got it. Then I''ll give you a nice, cool blue one!

      I thought
      you didn''t like red, and I guess I was right.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294879
    m_Localized: Maybe it's because of that memory...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294880
    m_Localized: Don't worry too much. I'll always be right beside you!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294881
    m_Localized: 'You know the man who runs the market?

      Have you noticed how
      he sometimes looks at you like you''re some precious treasure?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294882
    m_Localized: 'Even when I go there to buy something,

      he''s always looking
      over toward your shop!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294883
    m_Localized: He's a kind man.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294884
    m_Localized: It's a little uncomfortable.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294885
    m_Localized: 'Puhaha, he is kind...

      but sometimes he takes it a little
      too far, don''t you think?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294886
    m_Localized: 'The other day, I shouted as a joke,

      and you should''ve seen
      the terrifying look he gave me!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294887
    m_Localized: 'He looked like someone was picking on his own child!

      If
      anything happened to you, I bet he''d be the first one running over.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294888
    m_Localized: "(\uD50C\uB808\uC774\uC5B4 \uC774\uB984)!! I knew you could do it.\nThank
      you so much for bringing our village back to life!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294889
    m_Localized: I couldn't have done it without everyone.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294890
    m_Localized: 'But you''re the one who quietly held on and made it all the way
      here.

      I knew I had good instincts!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294891
    m_Localized: "You're the savior of our village, Boss (\uD50C\uB808\uC774\uC5B4
      \uC774\uB984)!\nYou worked so hard for this."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294892
    m_Localized: Let's keep having tons of fun together from now on!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294893
    m_Localized: Maybe I should open a shop of my own, just like you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294894
    m_Localized: "I heard something called a \u201CDubai chewy cookie\u201D is trendy
      on Earth these days. Do you know it?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294895
    m_Localized: I was thinking of grinding up meteors that only grow on our moon
      and mixing them in. What do you think?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294896
    m_Localized: Meteor cookies? We'd all break our teeth.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294897
    m_Localized: If they're a hit, save one for me.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294898
    m_Localized: 'Hey, I learned things from you too!

      I can just sift out
      all the hard pieces!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294899
    m_Localized: They'll be nuttier and sparklier with every bite~~!!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294900
    m_Localized: If business is slow, I guess I'll come ask you for advice!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294901
    m_Localized: 'Of course!

      For the owner of our village''s very first tea
      shop,

      I''ll serve up my absolute best one.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294902
    m_Localized: "Just you wait\u2014I'm going to build the greatest bakery chain
      in the universe~!!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294903
    m_Localized: Garam
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294904
    m_Localized: ...I believe this is our first meeting.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294905
    m_Localized: I am one of the rabbits who works at this mill.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294906
    m_Localized: "I heard that Shopkeeper (\uD50C\uB808\uC774\uC5B4 \uC774\uB984)
      had come to the village."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294907
    m_Localized: I look forward to working with you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294908
    m_Localized: Likewise. It's nice to meet you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294909
    m_Localized: It seems we'll be seeing each other often.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294910
    m_Localized: '...Yes. Tell me if you need anything.

      I may not say much,
      but I always finish the work entrusted to me.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294911
    m_Localized: 'So it would seem. The work of this mill

      will often find
      its way to your shop.

      Whenever it does, I will help as best I can.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294912
    m_Localized: ...You're here.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294913
    m_Localized: You have come.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294914
    m_Localized: What is it?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294915
    m_Localized: I can spare a moment to talk.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294916
    m_Localized: Go ahead.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294917
    m_Localized: Ask about the favor.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294918
    m_Localized: Everyday life
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294919
    m_Localized: The other rabbits
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294920
    m_Localized: The old days
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294921
    m_Localized: ...You're here.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294922
    m_Localized: ...Working hard again today, I see.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294923
    m_Localized: It is what I always do. ...You should not push yourself too hard
      either, Shopkeeper.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294924
    m_Localized: ...The mortar is honest. Cut corners, and the flavor changes at
      once.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294925
    m_Localized: Doesn't it wear you out?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294926
    m_Localized: I like how steady the rhythm is.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294927
    m_Localized: 'I am accustomed to it. ...

      You are the one working tirelessly
      to earn Starlight for our village. Your burden must be greater.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294928
    m_Localized: Take a short rest before you go.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294929
    m_Localized: I am glad. Idle thoughts disrupt the rhythm. The work demands focus.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294930
    m_Localized: (He silently stacks sacks of rice flour in a corner of the mill,
      brushing off the dust.)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294931
    m_Localized: (He is so focused that he does not notice anyone approaching.)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294932
    m_Localized: Garam, would you like some help?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294933
    m_Localized: '...! Ah, no. The flour will get everywhere, so please wait over
      there.

      I will be finished shortly.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294934
    m_Localized: (He wipes the sweat from his brow with a towel and pauses to catch
      his breath.)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294935
    m_Localized: (He stands the heavy pestle to one side and stares blankly into
      space.)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294936
    m_Localized: You should take a break.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294937
    m_Localized: You're sweating quite a lot.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294938
    m_Localized: ...Shopkeeper. Yes, well... I am almost done. Do not concern yourself
      with me.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294939
    m_Localized: '...I exerted myself somewhat.

      It is my duty to produce flour
      of the finest quality.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294940
    m_Localized: Somi... talks a great deal. I hope she has not been troubling you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294941
    m_Localized: Her cheerfulness gives me energy too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294942
    m_Localized: '...I am glad. I often worried she might burden you.

      Hearing
      you say that... puts my mind at ease as well.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294943
    m_Localized: 'That Maru... Has he been bothering you again?

      He can talk
      about data all he likes, but in the end, rice cakes are made with the heart.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294944
    m_Localized: Maru is intelligent, though.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294945
    m_Localized: "But there is such a thing as sincerity\u2014something numbers cannot
      contain."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294946
    m_Localized: Your rice cakes carry that sincerity. I suspect that is what Maru
      truly wishes to analyze.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294947
    m_Localized: 'About Mr. Horong...

      When I went to collect supplies, he
      seemed unusually generous only with you.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294948
    m_Localized: Were you aware of that?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294949
    m_Localized: Maybe he's kind to everyone.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294950
    m_Localized: '...Is that so?

      From what I observed, there was a distinct
      difference in how warmly he treated you compared with other customers.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294951
    m_Localized: I do not know the precise reason.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294952
    m_Localized: Did Somi... tell you about the old days? About coming to buy rice
      cakes every day...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294953
    m_Localized: She said you ignored her.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294954
    m_Localized: ...I was not ignoring her. I was too nervous to speak.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294955
    m_Localized: ......
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294956
    m_Localized: I did not know what to say, so I simply kept pounding the mortar.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294957
    m_Localized: My hands shook terribly whenever I passed her the bag of rice cakes...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294958
    m_Localized: .....Hmm...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294959
    m_Localized: I would rather not even remember the day Somi was injured.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294960
    m_Localized: You must have been terribly worried.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294961
    m_Localized: Until then, I did not know what it felt like to lose someone precious...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294962
    m_Localized: 'When someone becomes precious to you, Shopkeeper... you will understand.

      Your
      body moves before you have time to think.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294963
    m_Localized: The Moon Tree's light... is not what it once was. It concerns me
      greatly.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294964
    m_Localized: I was relieved when you opened the tea shop.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294965
    m_Localized: Can my rice cakes really help?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294966
    m_Localized: Your rice cakes are already bringing joy to the alien guests.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294967
    m_Localized: The more care you put into them, the more Starlight will return
      to revive the Moon Tree.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294968
    m_Localized: Ah, you mean the favor I asked of you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294969
    m_Localized: Thank you for attending to it. Your help made the work considerably
      easier.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294970
    m_Localized: We will speak again another time.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294971
    m_Localized: About the Moon Tree over there. Its light has grown somewhat brighter.
      That is not a bad thing.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294972
    m_Localized: 'Indeed. If one endures in silence, change will come eventually.

      That
      tree appears to be the same.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294973
    m_Localized: It must be regaining its strength little by little.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294974
    m_Localized: The village has grown much brighter. Being able to see clearly at
      night should make it safer. I am relieved.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294975
    m_Localized: Good. Somi was pleased as well.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294976
    m_Localized: I'm happy the village feels so alive again.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294977
    m_Localized: ...You know the old story of the moon rabbit pounding a mortar.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294978
    m_Localized: ...It is nothing remarkable.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294979
    m_Localized: It was simply me, my father, and my grandfather, always pounding
      the mortar.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294980
    m_Localized: ...Everyone gives it such a grand name. It is nothing special.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294981
    m_Localized: It is not impressive. It is merely a necessary part of making rice
      cakes.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294982
    m_Localized: Garam, are you the rabbit from the legend?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294983
    m_Localized: I can't believe the legendary rabbit was real!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294984
    m_Localized: ...Thump! ...Ah, Shopkeeper? Was my pounding too loud? Are you feeling
      unwell?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294985
    m_Localized: ...I apologize for startling you. The sound must have been too harsh.
      I will work more carefully.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294986
    m_Localized: ...You appear badly shaken. If there is a frightening memory behind
      it, do not force yourself to recall it. ...Would you like a glass of water?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294987
    m_Localized: (Garam remains visibly restless afterward.)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294988
    m_Localized: Oh, it was just loud. I'm all right.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294989
    m_Localized: ...The Moon Tree has regained all of its light. What was once dark
      is bright again. ...You have worked hard, Shopkeeper.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294990
    m_Localized: ...I merely did my duty. You were the one who endured, and you were
      the one who illuminated the dark road. You have done well.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294991
    m_Localized: We made it because you quietly held your ground, Garam.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294992
    m_Localized: ...I will continue protecting this mill together with Somi.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294993
    m_Localized: The strength that sustains an ordinary life comes not from grand
      words, but from quietly remaining where one belongs.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294994
    m_Localized: ...So, do not worry.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294995
    m_Localized: '...Indeed.

      If you ever face hardship, you may come to the
      mill at any time.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294996
    m_Localized: I will be here, as always.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294997
    m_Localized: '...Thank you.

      If you ever face hardship, you may come to
      the mill at any time.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294998
    m_Localized: I will be here, as always.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306294999
    m_Localized: I know the mill is safe in your hands.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295000
    m_Localized: I'll be cheering for the peaceful life you share.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295001
    m_Localized: Nuri
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295002
    m_Localized: Oh... This is the first time we've properly introduced ourselves.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295003
    m_Localized: I'm Nuri. I live with my older sister.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295004
    m_Localized: I've heard so much about the new tea shop. I'm happy to finally
      meet you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295005
    m_Localized: It's nice to meet you too, Nuri.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295006
    m_Localized: I hope we'll get along.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295007
    m_Localized: 'Hehe...

      I heard you''re gathering Starlight for our Moon
      Tree.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295008
    m_Localized: Thank you so much.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295009
    m_Localized: The roads at night have been darker ever since the Moon Tree's light
      weakened.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295010
    m_Localized: I'm all right, but I worry a little when my sister comes home late.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295011
    m_Localized: You really worry about Bori.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295012
    m_Localized: The village will be bright again someday.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295013
    m_Localized: Yes. My sister always looks after me first, but hardly ever thinks
      about herself.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295014
    m_Localized: So I want to be the one who waits for her.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295015
    m_Localized: I truly hope so.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295016
    m_Localized: I'd love to take a slow walk with my sister along the bright paths
      again.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295017
    m_Localized: The whole village has seemed a little lonely lately...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295018
    m_Localized: But the sweet aroma from your shop makes everything feel warmer
      than before.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295019
    m_Localized: Tell me if there's a treat you'd like to try.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295020
    m_Localized: I'll work hard to make the shop a success.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295021
    m_Localized: Really? Then I'll come choose one with my sister later.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295022
    m_Localized: I'm sure it'll taste even better if we share it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295023
    m_Localized: I'm sure you'll succeed.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295024
    m_Localized: The more guests smile after tasting your sweets, the more life will
      return to the village.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295025
    m_Localized: Oh, hello, Shopkeeper.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295026
    m_Localized: What would you like to talk about today?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295027
    m_Localized: You came to see me again.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295028
    m_Localized: For some reason, I feel a little more at ease whenever you're here.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295029
    m_Localized: I was walking quietly when you came to mind.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295030
    m_Localized: You don't mind talking for a little while, do you?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295031
    m_Localized: Ask about the favor.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295032
    m_Localized: Everyday life
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295033
    m_Localized: The other rabbits
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295034
    m_Localized: The old days
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295035
    m_Localized: Um... Have you seen the Moon Tree? It's only a tiny change, but
      it seems a little brighter than before... It makes my heart feel warm.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295036
    m_Localized: I saw it too. It made me happy.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295037
    m_Localized: Hehe... I'm glad. It feels like our dark village is slowly finding
      its light again, so I can't stop looking at it. I'm so happy.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295038
    m_Localized: Wow... Light is truly pouring from the tree now. The whole village
      is so bright, you can hardly tell it's night.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295039
    m_Localized: You're right. We can walk safely at night now.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295040
    m_Localized: Yes! I'm not afraid to go out late anymore. These days, I've found
      a small joy in taking quiet walks every night. It's all thanks to you, Shopkeeper.
      Hehe.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295041
    m_Localized: 'I went for a walk near the Moon Tree with my sister today.

      But
      it looked a little more wilted than before, and that made me sad.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295042
    m_Localized: Its light has definitely faded further.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295043
    m_Localized: I'll have to sell more rice cakes.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295044
    m_Localized: Yes... Even the leaves seem paler than they used to be.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295046
    m_Localized: 'Oh, my parents told me you opened the tea shop

      because of
      the Moon Tree.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295047
    m_Localized: Um... I don't know all the details, but I'm always grateful to you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295048
    m_Localized: 'A little puddle formed after last night''s rain,

      and the
      Earth was sitting perfectly round inside it!

      It was so pretty that I
      stared at it for ages.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295049
    m_Localized: I'd like to visit Earth someday too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295050
    m_Localized: You're quite the romantic, Nuri.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295051
    m_Localized: Didn't your clothes get wet?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295052
    m_Localized: 'Am I? After tasting your rice cakes,

      I think I''ve grown
      even more curious about Earth.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295053
    m_Localized: Let's go see it together someday. It will make your heart feel all
      soft and warm.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295054
    m_Localized: 'Oh... I did get a little wet, but I''m fine!

      I was so busy
      capturing that beautiful planet that I didn''t even notice. Hehe.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295055
    m_Localized: Um, Shopkeeper... Sometimes when the night sky glows red or there's
      a distant boom, you seem to shrink into yourself... It isn't because of something
      that happened long ago, is it?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295056
    m_Localized: ...I'm not sure. I don't remember very well.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295057
    m_Localized: Loud noises make me uneasy somehow.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295058
    m_Localized: Oh... I'm sorry. I hope I didn't uncover a painful memory. When
      I think of an empty place in your heart where a memory should be... my heart
      aches too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295059
    m_Localized: I see... I worried because red light and loud noises always seem
      to startle you. When I'm beside you, I'll quietly watch over you so you won't
      have to worry.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295060
    m_Localized: "The Moon Tree has finally regained all its light... Thank you\u2014truly\u2014for
      making our once-dark village so beautiful, Shopkeeper."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295061
    m_Localized: I couldn't have done it without you watching over us, Nuri.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295062
    m_Localized: Hehe, I didn't do anything... It was your sincere heart, quietly
      holding its ground, that reached the tree. You worked so hard.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295063
    m_Localized: My heart feels so full knowing we don't have to fear the dark anymore.
      Let's stay together in this beautiful village for a long, long time!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295064
    m_Localized: Actually... I recently learned how to make friends with aliens!
      If I approach quietly and offer them sparkling Starlight candy, they get shy,
      but they secretly love it. I think I'll have lots of friends now. Hehe.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295065
    m_Localized: That's such a kind method. It suits you perfectly.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295066
    m_Localized: Introduce me to your friend sometime!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295067
    m_Localized: Really? Hearing you say that gives me confidence...! Maybe even
      someone shy like me can make friends by sharing a kind heart. Thank you for
      giving me courage!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295068
    m_Localized: Yes, of course! Next time they visit, I'll quietly introduce you.
      We can all share something delicious together!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295069
    m_Localized: 'My sister Bori can be a little scary when she scolds me...

      But
      she''s really the kindest sister in the world.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295070
    m_Localized: She makes beautiful clothes for me every day.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295071
    m_Localized: You two are very close.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295072
    m_Localized: Bori really is talented at making clothes.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295073
    m_Localized: Yes! Even when something is bothering me, she listens all the way
      to the end. I don't think I could do anything without her.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295074
    m_Localized: That's right! My sister can even make pretty clothes from Moon Tree
      leaves.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295075
    m_Localized: It would be lovely if she made something for you too... I'll ask
      her later!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295076
    m_Localized: My sister Bori sometimes sounds cold, but when I'm sick, she stays
      up all night changing the wet cloth on my forehead. She's the only sister like
      her in the world.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295077
    m_Localized: She looks so amazing when she's concentrating on her sewing.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295078
    m_Localized: You really admire your sister.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295079
    m_Localized: Bori is a true professional.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295080
    m_Localized: Yes! I want to become a rabbit who can confidently do her share,
      just like my sister.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295081
    m_Localized: But when she pushes herself too hard, I quietly leave some carrot
      juice beside her.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295082
    m_Localized: Exactly! She never overlooks even a single loose thread. She's a
      real professional.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295083
    m_Localized: "Whenever Maru sees me, he adjusts his glasses and starts using
      difficult words. Something about \u201Cdata\u201D... But he always remembers
      to bring me apple juice."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295084
    m_Localized: Maru is a little unusual, isn't he?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295085
    m_Localized: He has a bit of a tsundere side.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295086
    m_Localized: ...A little! But it also seems amazing that he can calculate such
      difficult things.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295087
    m_Localized: Sometimes his eyes look very warm behind his glasses.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295088
    m_Localized: "What's a \u201Ctsundere\u201D? Anyway, he grumbles, but he always
      prepares my favorite snacks in advance."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295089
    m_Localized: He only says strange things when we meet... but he's a kind big
      brother.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295090
    m_Localized: The man at the market always gives me something extra. Sometimes
      I feel guilty because it seems like he's practically giving things away.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295091
    m_Localized: He's very generous.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295092
    m_Localized: He does that for me too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295093
    m_Localized: Right? He must think of every rabbit in the village as his own child.
      He has such a generous heart.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295094
    m_Localized: Oh? He does it for you too? His eyes seem especially misty whenever
      he looks at you... Or am I imagining it?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295095
    m_Localized: 'They say the Moon Tree used to shine brilliantly whenever a shooting
      star fell.

      It was full of life because so many people made wishes upon
      it.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295096
    m_Localized: Why doesn't that happen anymore?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295097
    m_Localized: Grandma says the rabbits grew so busy that they forgot how to dream.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295098
    m_Localized: The tree draws strength from the rabbits' hopes and wishes, so now
      it's withering away. Isn't that sad?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295099
    m_Localized: 'I saw a purple spaceship pass by last night!

      Aliens collect
      sparkling Starlight and use it to buy things, right?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295100
    m_Localized: We can use that Starlight too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295101
    m_Localized: I want to make an alien friend.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295102
    m_Localized: Oh! Then the Starlight you gather becomes power for the Moon Tree!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295103
    m_Localized: "Shopkeeper (\uD50C\uB808\uC774\uC5B4 \uC774\uB984), you're doing
      something truly amazing."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295104
    m_Localized: 'Aren''t you scared? They travel in such enormous spaceships...

      But
      if they come to eat your sweets, perhaps you could become friends right away.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295105
    m_Localized: 'My grandmother says there wasn''t a single building here long ago.

      Apparently,
      there was only one enormous mortar.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295106
    m_Localized: A lot has changed since then, hasn't it?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295107
    m_Localized: Do you think it was better back then?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295108
    m_Localized: 'Yes... She says the new conveniences are nice,

      but sometimes
      she misses how peaceful it used to be.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295109
    m_Localized: 'I''m not sure. I like the village as it is now!

      It smells
      of delicious rice cakes, and everyone works so hard.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295110
    m_Localized: Oh, you brought the rice cakes I ordered! Thank you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295111
    m_Localized: I was so hungry, and you arrived at the perfect time.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295112
    m_Localized: I'll let you know if I need anything again.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295113
    m_Localized: Maru
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295114
    m_Localized: A pleasure to meet you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295115
    m_Localized: I am Maru. Observing and documenting the various phenomena in this
      village is a personal interest of mine.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295116
    m_Localized: I have already received a certain amount of information about you...
      but a direct introduction would be more accurate.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295117
    m_Localized: You don't have to be so formal...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295118
    m_Localized: Nice to meet you, Maru.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295119
    m_Localized: ...Is that so? Understood. I will be somewhat less formal, then.
      I look forward to working with you, Shopkeeper.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295120
    m_Localized: Our mutual pleasure has been confirmed. Excellent. If I acquire
      information you may find interesting, I will prioritize sharing it with you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295121
    m_Localized: I have been recording the Moon Tree's recent light output.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295122
    m_Localized: There are minor variations between measurements, but the overall
      downward trend is unmistakable.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295123
    m_Localized: Can you keep recording it?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295124
    m_Localized: Is there anything I can do?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295125
    m_Localized: Of course. Change should not be assessed through intuition alone.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295126
    m_Localized: Without precise records, we cannot verify whether the tree is recovering.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295127
    m_Localized: It is too early to reach a definitive conclusion.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295128
    m_Localized: However, selling sweets to alien guests and collecting their Starlight
      is certainly worthy of observation.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295129
    m_Localized: I have heard that alien guests are showing interest in traditional
      sweets from Earth.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295130
    m_Localized: However, we still lack sufficient data regarding their preferred
      flavors and forms.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295131
    m_Localized: I'll watch the guests' reactions carefully.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295132
    m_Localized: Would you like to observe them at the shop?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295133
    m_Localized: A sound decision.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295134
    m_Localized: By consistently recording order frequency and reactions, we may
      discover a more stable method of collecting Starlight.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295135
    m_Localized: An intriguing proposal.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295136
    m_Localized: Even if my purpose is observation, including a tasting would enable
      a more accurate analysis.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295137
    m_Localized: Hello.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295138
    m_Localized: You have a moment for conversation, I presume?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295139
    m_Localized: It is relatively quiet today.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295140
    m_Localized: Conditions like these are ideal for sharing several observations.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295141
    m_Localized: You have arrived.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295142
    m_Localized: As it happens, I have some interesting data to share with you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295143
    m_Localized: Listen to his concern.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295144
    m_Localized: Everyday life
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295145
    m_Localized: The other rabbits
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295146
    m_Localized: The old days
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295147
    m_Localized: Thank you for listening.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295148
    m_Localized: Speaking with you seems to organize the data in my mind.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295149
    m_Localized: Please return when you have time.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295150
    m_Localized: Have you observed the Moon Tree? Allowing for a minor margin of
      error, my analysis indicates its light output has increased by approximately
      4.2 percent.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295151
    m_Localized: Everything suddenly looks clearer.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295152
    m_Localized: There is no need for astonishment. It is the natural result of data-based
      observation. The rising values are a positive sign.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295153
    m_Localized: A thought occurred to me while polishing my glasses. Your focus
      occasionally becomes unfixed. Could you require an eye examination?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295154
    m_Localized: Sometimes I just zone out.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295155
    m_Localized: My eyesight is fine.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295156
    m_Localized: Zoning out and visual acuity are separate issues, however...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295157
    m_Localized: .....
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295158
    m_Localized: I suspect a specific region of your brain may be overloading while
      attempting to retrieve memories. Do not overexert yourself for the time being.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295159
    m_Localized: Your physical eyesight may be sound, but at times you look past
      what is before you, as though staring at something very far away.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295160
    m_Localized: At moments like those, I find myself wishing I could lend you my
      glasses.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295161
    m_Localized: Do not forget that even a one-degree difference while melting sugar
      alters its viscosity. Consistent quality is essential to your tea shop.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295162
    m_Localized: Thanks for the advice.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295163
    m_Localized: I rely on instinct.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295164
    m_Localized: There is no need to thank me. If the village's only tea shop closed,
      it would disrupt my planned sugar intake.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295165
    m_Localized: "\u201CInstinct\u201D... What an exceptionally unscientific word."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295166
    m_Localized: "And yet, the fact that your \u201Cinstinct\u201D ranks first in
      preference among the village rabbits is highly intriguing."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295167
    m_Localized: Miso appears to expend approximately 1.5 times the calories of an
      average rabbit each day.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295168
    m_Localized: Running around like that will place excessive strain on her joints.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295169
    m_Localized: I like how cheerful Miso is.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295170
    m_Localized: She can be a little overwhelming.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295171
    m_Localized: Cheerfulness is positive, but her entropy is excessively high.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295172
    m_Localized: However... my statistics show that your heart rate is most stable
      when Miso is beside you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295173
    m_Localized: Ever since we were children, Miso has functioned as a stabilizing
      agent for you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295174
    m_Localized: Do you know how lighting technology was introduced to the moon?
      Our ancestors collected luminescent meteors from their wandering homeworld,
      refined their energy, and projected it to construct an artificial light source.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295175
    m_Localized: So it was made from refined meteors.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295176
    m_Localized: Science and technology are incredible.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295177
    m_Localized: Correct. They analyzed the composition of fallen meteors and extracted
      light from them. Our ancestors' engineering approach was notably efficient.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295178
    m_Localized: Indeed. This system reproduces a natural light source through technology,
      allowing our ecosystem's thermal cycle to remain stable.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295179
    m_Localized: Observing Garam and Somi at the mill reveals an example of perfect
      harmony.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295180
    m_Localized: Garam's pounding rhythm is more precise than a metronome.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295181
    m_Localized: Garam is like a master craftsman.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295182
    m_Localized: It seems Somi takes the lead.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295183
    m_Localized: "\u201CMaster craftsman\u201D is a subjective term, but I acknowledge
      that his margin of striking error is virtually nonexistent."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295184
    m_Localized: What is remarkable is that his precision remains unaffected regardless
      of how loudly Somi talks beside him.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295185
    m_Localized: It is a peculiar synchronization that cannot be explained through
      any physical or logical basis.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295186
    m_Localized: Objectively, Somi's energy expenditure is overwhelming. Yet Garam
      absorbs all that energy and silently continues producing results.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295187
    m_Localized: Their interaction defies every law of dynamics known to me. A truly
      fascinating harmony.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295188
    m_Localized: As the Moon Tree's growth accelerates, the village's overall illumination
      has improved to a statistically significant degree. The very concept of night
      is becoming nearly irrelevant.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295189
    m_Localized: It certainly seems that way, doesn't it?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295190
    m_Localized: Yes. The Moon Tree is currently demonstrating photosynthetic efficiency
      beyond its biological limits. With these data, we may be sufficiently optimistic
      about its final-stage values.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295191
    m_Localized: The loss of data in a particular section of your neural circuitry...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295192
    m_Localized: I still do not believe it was a natural phenomenon. It was likely
      a self-defense mechanism triggered by severe trauma.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295193
    m_Localized: It hurts when I try to remember.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295194
    m_Localized: Do not attempt to retrieve it by force. You will overload the system.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295195
    m_Localized: ...However, the enormous metal wreckage that fell from the sky that
      night, and the red heat...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295196
    m_Localized: "Everything you told me\u2014I have documented all of it."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295197
    m_Localized: .....
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295198
    m_Localized: Someday, I intend to logically prove the true nature of the horror
      you were forced to witness.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295199
    m_Localized: In theory, liquid water should not exist in a lunar environment.
      Yet our village has somehow developed a stable aquatic ecosystem and even an
      artificial sea. Do you not find that remarkable?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104306295200
    m_Localized: It's strange that water exists here when this is the moon...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877696
    m_Localized: There is a high probability that an unknown physical mechanism is
      involved. I am investigating it from multiple angles, but for now, the optimal
      course is to appreciate and utilize this environmental advantage.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877697
    m_Localized: Furthermore, regular wave sounds can be audibly detected near the
      water. If operating your shop becomes exhausting, visit the shore. The auditory
      stimulus should produce a psychologically stabilizing effect.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877698
    m_Localized: For a merchant, the market owner shows remarkably little interest
      in profit.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877699
    m_Localized: The goods he sells you in particular are priced nearly below cost.
      From a business perspective, he receives a failing grade.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877700
    m_Localized: Maybe he's looking out for me.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877701
    m_Localized: He's simply kindhearted.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877702
    m_Localized: "The pricing data are far too abnormal to dismiss with words such
      as \u201Cconsideration\u201D or \u201Ckindness.\u201D"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877703
    m_Localized: His goods are priced almost exactly at cost, as though charging
      even slightly more would cause him unbearable guilt.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877704
    m_Localized: He appears entirely devoid of a merchant's desire for profit. What
      objective could justify accepting such losses?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877705
    m_Localized: I monitored your recent sales indicators and inventory turnover.
      The response to your newly launched selection is quite encouraging. Diversifying
      your production appears to have been effective.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877706
    m_Localized: You even analyzed my sales?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877707
    m_Localized: I'll keep creating a wider variety of items.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877708
    m_Localized: Market analysis is fundamental to commerce. I continuously monitor
      this level of data to ensure efficient resource allocation.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877709
    m_Localized: I look forward to the results. Combining your intuitive recipes
      with my statistical analysis should maximize the economic value of this commercial
      district.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877710
    m_Localized: Dasri, did you hear the engine of that transport ship that just
      passed overhead?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877711
    m_Localized: It contained a low-frequency component near 60 Hz. Why has your
      complexion suddenly become so pale?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877712
    m_Localized: My ears just feel a little blocked...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877713
    m_Localized: I heard an unpleasant sound.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877714
    m_Localized: Your pupils contracted too rapidly for this to be simple tinnitus.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877715
    m_Localized: Just before you lost your memory, a similar sound occurred when
      an enormous spaceship ascended while spewing flames.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877716
    m_Localized: "The other rabbits insist it was merely thunder, but my recording
      device captured it clearly. It was not a natural sound\u2014it was an artificial
      rupture."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877717
    m_Localized: "Your body still appears to associate that sound with an \u201Cexplosion.\u201D
      Focus on my voice. It is a stable, low-mid frequency of 150 Hz."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877718
    m_Localized: I completed my final review of the Moon Tree's stage-seven restoration
      data. Full light recovery has optimized every efficiency metric in the village.
      Your decision was correct. Well done.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877719
    m_Localized: I couldn't have done it without your analysis and help.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877720
    m_Localized: Hmm... My contribution amounted only to supplementary calculations.
      Your ability to act produced the actual result. An excellent achievement. You
      worked hard.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877721
    m_Localized: Analysis of the data following the Moon Tree's complete recovery
      reveals a considerable backlog of research questions in aerospace engineering
      and ecology.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877722
    m_Localized: I have decided to pursue a formal research career and intend to
      follow a more advanced academic curriculum.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877723
    m_Localized: You'll make an excellent researcher.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877724
    m_Localized: Write an amazing paper someday and show me.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877725
    m_Localized: Thank you for the encouragement. Through rigorous hypothesis testing
      and research, I will contribute academically to the development of this moon
      village.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877726
    m_Localized: You may look forward to it. Just as you grew your shop, I will prove
      myself in my field through meaningful data and results.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877727
    m_Localized: Bori
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877728
    m_Localized: "Hello, Shopkeeper (\uD50C\uB808\uC774\uC5B4 \uC774\uB984)."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877729
    m_Localized: 'My name is Bori.

      I hear you''ve already met my younger sister.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877730
    m_Localized: Hello, Bori.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877731
    m_Localized: I hope we'll get along.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877732
    m_Localized: Likewise. I run a clothing shop, so I imagine we'll see each other
      often.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877733
    m_Localized: I look forward to it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877734
    m_Localized: "Whether you're steaming rice cakes or sewing clothes, you're ultimately
      selling something made with heart, aren't you?\nYou do realize your sweets
      are becoming the village's hope, don't you, (\uD50C\uB808\uC774\uC5B4 \uC774\uB984)?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877735
    m_Localized: That's too much praise. You're embarrassing me.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877736
    m_Localized: I'll have to work even harder.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877737
    m_Localized: There's no need to be embarrassed. The guests look genuinely happy
      when they leave your shop.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877738
    m_Localized: I mean it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877739
    m_Localized: 'That attitude is more than enough.

      The more care you put
      in, the more the Moon Tree''s light will return.

      I''ll do everything
      I can to help as well.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877740
    m_Localized: 'The Moon Tree''s leaves look duller than usual today. It''s concerning.

      They''re
      a material for my clothes, yes,

      but they''re also proof that the village
      is losing power.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877741
    m_Localized: You have a sharp eye, Bori.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877742
    m_Localized: A power shortage would be disastrous.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877743
    m_Localized: 'Color is one of a designer''s keenest concerns.

      If the power
      weakens, the village lights will dim,

      and my clothes will lose their
      brilliance too.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877744
    m_Localized: "You need to stay alert too, (\uD50C\uB808\uC774\uC5B4 \uC774\uB984)!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877745
    m_Localized: 'The automated machines would stop, and your electric oven would
      fail as well.

      That''s precisely why we need to gather Starlight more
      diligently!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877746
    m_Localized: 'The voltage in my studio has been unstable lately.

      That
      means there''s a serious fault in the Moon Tree''s power grid.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877747
    m_Localized: The emptiness in the villagers' hearts must have grown considerably.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877748
    m_Localized: What can I do to help?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877749
    m_Localized: Should we ask Maru?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877750
    m_Localized: 'You need to keep selling rice cakes!

      Make their aroma fill
      the whole village square!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877751
    m_Localized: And I need to get back to making clothes at once.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877752
    m_Localized: "Maru only talks about data. It's tedious.\nYou're diligently feeding
      Starlight into the Moon Tree, (\uD50C\uB808\uC774\uC5B4 \uC774\uB984),\nso
      I'm sure everything will stabilize soon enough."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877753
    m_Localized: 'Garam at the mill is remarkably steadfast. He may look stern, but
      he never argues with Somi.

      A business needs that kind of trust to last.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877754
    m_Localized: They make a wonderful couple.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877755
    m_Localized: Garam is a little frightening.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877756
    m_Localized: "They're perfect proof that opposites attract\u2014the village's
      favorite lovebirds."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877757
    m_Localized: 'Don''t be afraid.

      Just think of him as a robot Somi knows
      how to operate.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877758
    m_Localized: 'You know the Starlight fragments aliens use to pay aren''t merely
      currency, don''t you?

      They''re crystals of pure cosmic energy.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877759
    m_Localized: 'I make clothes with Starlight

      because its energy wraps gently
      around the wearer''s spirit.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877760
    m_Localized: So Starlight clothing is functional!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877761
    m_Localized: Aliens must be wealthy.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877762
    m_Localized: 'Yes. It calms your mind the instant you put it on.

      Once
      I make you a special Starlight apron,

      you''ll feel much more at ease
      while working too.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877763
    m_Localized: 'It''s less about wealth and more about having different resources.

      What
      may be ordinary space dust to them is a power source that restores our hearts.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877764
    m_Localized: Which is why I charge them a premium for my clothes.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877765
    m_Localized: Consider that my lesson in business. Hehe.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877766
    m_Localized: 'Grandma Deunhae is truly remarkable.

      She raised someone
      as capable as you in this time of crisis.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877767
    m_Localized: Grandma is the person I owe everything to.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877768
    m_Localized: Grandma can be rather strict.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877769
    m_Localized: Without her profound foresight, your tea shop wouldn't exist.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877770
    m_Localized: ...Was that answer a little too formal?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877771
    m_Localized: 'A true master is bound to be demanding.

      Isn''t that strictness
      what honed your skill to such a fine edge?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877772
    m_Localized: "While the people of Earth dismissed us as superstition,\nwe made
      extraordinary progress\u2014but we lost a great deal in return."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877773
    m_Localized: Clear, open land vanished as buildings and factories moved in.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877774
    m_Localized: Progress isn't always a good thing.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877775
    m_Localized: But life has become more convenient.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877776
    m_Localized: 'Exactly. We became so obsessed with efficiency that we left no
      room

      for the pure wishes the Moon Tree needs to survive.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877777
    m_Localized: Your tea shop has created that room again.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877778
    m_Localized: 'Of course. I couldn''t make clothes without my modern sewing machine
      either.

      But your rice cakes must fill the emptiness

      that machines
      never can.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877779
    m_Localized: That's how this village maintains its balance.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877780
    m_Localized: Look at the Moon Tree. It's subtle, but its colors are a little
      more vivid than before.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877781
    m_Localized: Exactly. That slight rise in saturation makes the entire village
      look more polished. I find it a very pleasing change.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877782
    m_Localized: You're right. Everything feels much softer.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877783
    m_Localized: I'm sketching a new clothing line. To complement the village's brighter
      light, I'm considering fabric with a delicate shimmer. Fashion lives or dies
      by its harmony with its surroundings.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877784
    m_Localized: Hehe, hearing you put it so beautifully is giving me even more inspiration.
      If a design catches your eye later, do let me know.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877785
    m_Localized: Doesn't it sound lovely? I'm carefully designing it so the silhouette
      falls perfectly in the light. You'll be the first to see it when it's finished.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877786
    m_Localized: Anything you make is bound to be beautiful.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877787
    m_Localized: Shimmering fabric? I can't wait.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877788
    m_Localized: Nuri has been visiting your shop often, hasn't she? She's always
      been so shy and anxious that I worried about her, but lately she comes home
      smiling. It's all thanks to you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877789
    m_Localized: She's kind, but has trouble expressing herself and suffers alone.
      As her sister, I'm truly grateful that you watch over her so warmly. I'll repay
      you with a lovely apron soon.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877790
    m_Localized: Nuri is so kind that I'm the grateful one.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877791
    m_Localized: "With the Moon Tree this bright, I no longer need to account for
      the lighting color when choosing fabric. The whole village is visibly brighter\u2014an
      ideal environment for design work."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877792
    m_Localized: Yes, I can see delicate stitches and colors accurately now. Matching
      saturation was so difficult when everything was dim...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877793
    m_Localized: I suppose a better environment really does make everything more
      beautiful. And it's all thanks to how well you've cared for the tree.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877794
    m_Localized: Your work must be much easier now.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877795
    m_Localized: Nuri is so quiet and shy that she even hides what she truly wants.
      As her sister, I want her to stop worrying about others and freely pursue what
      she genuinely loves.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877796
    m_Localized: Thank you, Shopkeeper. She has such a thoughtful heart. If I quietly
      support her from behind, she'll find her own wonderful path someday, won't
      she?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877797
    m_Localized: I imagine every older sister feels the same. Please stay beside
      Nuri as a good friend, so she never loses heart.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877798
    m_Localized: Nuri will succeed at anything she chooses.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877799
    m_Localized: You're a very caring sister.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877800
    m_Localized: Come to think of it, this entire moon village used to be nothing
      but an endless, bleak pile of gray stones. It was nothing like the lush, beautiful
      place it is now... So much has changed since you came.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877801
    m_Localized: Exactly. Who would have imagined that gray moon, dreary day and
      night, could become so full of life? Remembering all the years we endured that
      desolation makes this deeply moving.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877802
    m_Localized: It really was a desolate place before.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877803
    m_Localized: Whenever there's a red sunset or a thunderous noise, your expression
      stiffens. It isn't a painful memory of someone, is it? I don't mean to pry...
      I'm simply worried.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877804
    m_Localized: I see. Having incomplete memories must be terribly painful. Wounds
      left in the heart can remain frightening even after time passes. Please don't
      force yourself to remember.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877805
    m_Localized: I don't remember the details, but my heart suddenly lurches.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877806
    m_Localized: With the Moon Tree fully restored, the village's saturation and
      brightness are perfect. As a designer, being able to work beneath such flawless
      light is a truly moving finale.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877807
    m_Localized: That's right. We never could have done it alone. Thank you sincerely
      for protecting this beautiful village.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877808
    m_Localized: I'll show you even finer work from now on, so I can live up to everyone's
      hopes. Shopkeeper, you truly did an incredible job.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877809
    m_Localized: We succeeded because everyone worked together.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877810
    m_Localized: Now that the Moon Tree has its light back, I think I'll strike out
      on my own and officially open a magnificent clothing shop.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877811
    m_Localized: I'll earn plenty of money here, buy every delicious thing my timid
      little sister Nuri wants, and dress her in all the beautiful clothes she could
      dream of. A splendid plan, don't you think?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877812
    m_Localized: Of course! I'm more confident in my skill than anyone. Just as you
      built your shop into something wonderful, I'll create a brilliant brand under
      my own name. Just wait and see!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877813
    m_Localized: Thank you. I'll never forget your support. Let's both keep shining
      brilliantly in our own places!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877814
    m_Localized: You'll be incredibly successful, Bori!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877815
    m_Localized: Nuri will be thrilled. I'm rooting for you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877816
    m_Localized: Somi
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877817
    m_Localized: Oh my, we finally get to meet properly!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877818
    m_Localized: "I'm Somi\u2014the loudest, brightest, and friendliest rabbit at
      the mill!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877819
    m_Localized: I heard all about you ages ago, Boss. Let's become great friends!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877820
    m_Localized: Sounds good. Nice to meet you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877821
    m_Localized: You're full of energy already.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877822
    m_Localized: Hehe, I knew we'd get along! Come visit the mill next time. I'll
      show you delicious ingredients and tell you loads of fun stories!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877823
    m_Localized: "Right? Sitting still feels like your mouth's stuffed with cotton!
      I'm already excited\u2014I bet I'll have even more fun with you around!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877824
    m_Localized: Welcome, Boss! It's another exciting day at the mill.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877825
    m_Localized: What should we talk about first?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877826
    m_Localized: Oh my, perfect timing!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877827
    m_Localized: It's just the right moment for chatting along to the pounding mortar.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877828
    m_Localized: You're here, Boss!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877829
    m_Localized: I've got tons of cheerful stories for you today.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877830
    m_Localized: Ask about the favor.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877831
    m_Localized: Everyday life
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877832
    m_Localized: The other rabbits
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877833
    m_Localized: The old days
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877834
    m_Localized: "Good morning, Boss (\uD50C\uB808\uC774\uC5B4 \uC774\uB984)!\nThat
      delicious rice-cake aroma is drifting all the way to the mill again!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877835
    m_Localized: You look happy today, Somi.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877836
    m_Localized: Ding-dong-ding! Correct!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877837
    m_Localized: 'There''s no space dust today,

      and your shop is packed with
      guests, so I''m excited too!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877838
    m_Localized: I'll carry this wonderful mood straight into making perfect ingredients
      today!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877839
    m_Localized: (Thump-thump-thump!) Hear that?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877840
    m_Localized: 'Other people might call it noisy,

      but to me, it''s the best
      music in the world.

      What do you think, Boss?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877841
    m_Localized: I like the sound.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877842
    m_Localized: Sometimes it makes my ears ring.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877843
    m_Localized: 'I knew you had an artist''s soul!

      That rhythm makes me want
      to dance!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877844
    m_Localized: 'I can understand that!

      Garam''s arm strength is no joke.
      Haha!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877845
    m_Localized: Boss! Did you see the yellow flowers outside our mill?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877846
    m_Localized: 'Garam grumbles that they get underfoot,

      but he never pulls
      them and waters them every day. Isn''t that funny?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877847
    m_Localized: Garam is very sweet.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877848
    m_Localized: Didn't you tell him to do it?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877849
    m_Localized: 'Hahaha! Exactly!

      He stands in front of them with that stern
      face...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877850
    m_Localized: 'Go take a peek sometime.

      I bet he''ll get embarrassed and
      run for his life!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877851
    m_Localized: Oh, he'd never do it if I ordered him to!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877852
    m_Localized: 'He must have started caring without even realizing it.

      He''s
      secretly softhearted.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877853
    m_Localized: 'What''s for lunch today, Boss?

      Garam and I are having freshly
      steamed rice cakes dipped in lots of sweet honey!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877854
    m_Localized: If you're still deciding, how does my recommendation sound?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877855
    m_Localized: Honey rice cakes? That sounds delicious!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877856
    m_Localized: I'm just having a light carrot.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877857
    m_Localized: 'I knew you had good taste!

      You need something sweet to power
      through the afternoon rush.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877858
    m_Localized: 'I''ll send over some rice cakes we made later.

      You can judge
      them for us. Haha!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877859
    m_Localized: 'Oh, Boss, you eat far too little!

      If you ever run out of
      energy, dash over to the mill.

      I''ll fix you a hearty snack!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877860
    m_Localized: 'You know Mr. Horong at the market?

      Whenever you show up,
      his eyes simply melt.

      Anyone would think he was your father!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877861
    m_Localized: He's a very kind man.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877862
    m_Localized: 'He''s always been warmhearted.

      Seeing hardworking youngsters
      like you

      must bring back a lot of memories.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877863
    m_Localized: 'Just happily accept all those extras he gives you.

      That''s
      what makes him happy.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877864
    m_Localized: That Maru came to measure our mill again today. Something about
      Garam's margin of striking error... Talking to him feels like talking to a
      robot!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877865
    m_Localized: Maru is intelligent, though.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877866
    m_Localized: Garam must find him exhausting.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877867
    m_Localized: He's smart, but sometimes all that intelligence exhausts everyone
      else!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877868
    m_Localized: Still, he keeps our machines running without breaking, so I suppose
      we have to put up with him. Right?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877869
    m_Localized: Not necessarily.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877870
    m_Localized: Garam pretends to ignore him, but after Maru leaves, he quietly
      asks me whether his pounding looked strange!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877871
    m_Localized: Watching those two bicker is like seeing a comedy duo!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877872
    m_Localized: 'Lots of rabbits ask how Garam and I ended up married.

      It
      wasn''t easy for me at first!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877873
    m_Localized: 'I fell for him at first sight and visited the mill every day.

      But
      he wouldn''t even look at me!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877874
    m_Localized: Garam did that?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877875
    m_Localized: So you made the first move!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877876
    m_Localized: 'I''m serious!

      He just kept pounding away as if I wasn''t
      there.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877877
    m_Localized: "I'd say, \u201CThese rice cakes are delicious!\u201D and all I
      got was \u201C...Yes.\u201D\nJust remembering it makes me want to explode!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877878
    m_Localized: 'But then one day...

      Oh, this is getting long. Shall I tell
      you the rest next time?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877879
    m_Localized: "Of course! \u201CGive up\u201D isn't in my dictionary.\nYou have
      no idea how hard I worked just to make eye contact!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877880
    m_Localized: 'But then one day...

      Oh, this is getting long. I''ll tell
      you the rest next time!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877881
    m_Localized: 'Remember the story I started last time?

      One day, I took
      a terrible fall on a walk and ended up in the hospital.

      I couldn''t
      even contact anyone...'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877882
    m_Localized: 'Then that gruff rabbit came running in

      looking as if he
      was about to cry. Funny, isn''t it?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877883
    m_Localized: Garam must have been terribly worried.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877884
    m_Localized: Wow, that's genuinely touching.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877885
    m_Localized: You have no idea! He was so frightened he was practically in tears!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877886
    m_Localized: That's when I knew. This rabbit would stay beside me for the rest
      of my life.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877887
    m_Localized: I hope you find a rabbit like that someday too, Boss!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877888
    m_Localized: 'Boss.

      Did you know the Moon Tree used to be even larger
      and more dazzling?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877889
    m_Localized: 'When we all made wishes beneath it, Starlight fell like rain.

      It
      was truly dreamlike.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877890
    m_Localized: Do you think we'll see it again?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877891
    m_Localized: "Of course! You're working so hard\nfor the village, Boss (\uD50C\uB808\uC774\uC5B4
      \uC774\uB984)."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877892
    m_Localized: 'My instincts tell me so!

      Combine Garam''s pounding rhythm
      with the aroma of your sweets, and the Moon Tree is sure to awaken!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877893
    m_Localized: Oh, you mean the favor I asked about?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877894
    m_Localized: You made the mill's work so much easier. I knew I could count on
      you!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877895
    m_Localized: I'll repay you with even better ingredients next time.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877896
    m_Localized: 'Boss, have you seen the Moon Tree?

      Doesn''t it look far
      more sparkly than before?'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877897
    m_Localized: The whole village feels brighter, so I'm extra excited today!!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877898
    m_Localized: It makes work even more fun! I hope it keeps shining more beautifully.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877899
    m_Localized: It really does look like the tree is recovering.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877900
    m_Localized: To tell you the truth, when we first opened the mill, I was terrified
      we'd never get a single customer.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877901
    m_Localized: Thanks to your shop, word spread about our mill too, and we managed
      to succeed.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877902
    m_Localized: I mean it! I'm not just being polite!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877903
    m_Localized: 'Of course! You''re our marriage''s lucky star!

      We''ll make
      you plenty of delicious flour, so look forward to it!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877904
    m_Localized: Let's make both our businesses huge successes!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877905
    m_Localized: I'm glad my shop could help.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877906
    m_Localized: 'Wow, do you see that tree shining?

      Its light pours into
      the mill like sunlight. What a sight!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877907
    m_Localized: 'Right? The whole world seems to sparkle, so every day feels like
      a festival.

      It''s all because you cared for the tree so beautifully~!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877908
    m_Localized: The village feels so much livelier now.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877909
    m_Localized: Come to think of it... your mother was such a warm person too, long
      ago. Oh my, why did I suddenly say that...? N-never mind! I was just rambling
      about old memories, so don't pay any attention!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877910
    m_Localized: "Well... I only happened to see her briefly, a very long time ago!
      I startled you by bringing up the past, didn't I? Sorry\u2014I'm so sorry.
      That was thoughtless of me. ...I should get back to work!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877911
    m_Localized: "Well... I only happened to see her briefly, a very long time ago!
      I startled you by bringing up the past, didn't I? Sorry\u2014I'm so sorry.
      That was thoughtless of me. ...I should get back to work!"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877912
    m_Localized: You knew my mother?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877913
    m_Localized: Do you know anything else about my mother?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877914
    m_Localized: Ever since I married Garam, we've been running this mill side by
      side, right?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877915
    m_Localized: 'Things felt uncertain at first,

      but now every day is exciting
      because we''re building something together.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877916
    m_Localized: Thank you! Garam may be rough around the edges, but he's incredibly
      gentle inside.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877917
    m_Localized: We'll work even harder and make this the most popular mill in the
      moon village!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877918
    m_Localized: And I'll always be cheering for you too, Boss!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877919
    m_Localized: You two are wonderful together.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877920
    m_Localized: 'Wow, the Moon Tree has regained all its light!

      I can''t
      believe the moon village feels so alive again.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877921
    m_Localized: You ran all the way to the end for us, Boss. You're the best!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877922
    m_Localized: We only stayed beside you! You're the one who lit the village so
      beautifully.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877923
    m_Localized: 'You worked so hard, Boss!

      Now we can make rice cakes happily
      every single day. Hooray!'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877924
    m_Localized: I couldn't have done it without you and Garam cheering me on.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877925
    m_Localized: Now that the Moon Tree shines so beautifully, Garam and I will keep
      running this mill for years while dreaming sweet dreams together! We'll fill
      every day with the nutty aroma of rice cakes and let our happiness grow soft
      and warm. Hehe!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877926
    m_Localized: Thank you, Boss! We'll make it a huge success! Let's both keep working
      hard and living brilliantly. We can do it!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877927
    m_Localized: Of course! You know you're always our top VIP, right? Let's both
      keep working hard and living brilliantly. We can do it!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877928
    m_Localized: I hope your mill always prospers!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877929
    m_Localized: Can I visit every day for free rice cakes?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877930
    m_Localized: Horong
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877931
    m_Localized: Ho ho, so you're the young rabbit opening the new tea shop.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877932
    m_Localized: The name's Horong. I'm an old rabbit who's kept this shop running
      for many a year.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877933
    m_Localized: I'm glad to see a young rabbit running a shop of their own, though
      I can't help but worry a little... In any case, welcome.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877934
    m_Localized: I look forward to getting to know you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877935
    m_Localized: Is there really that much to worry about?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877936
    m_Localized: Ho ho, indeed. A shop may seem like a one-rabbit affair, but sooner
      or later, you'll need a helping paw from everyone in town. Come to me whenever
      you need anything.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877937
    m_Localized: I only worry that a young rabbit like you might work yourself to
      the bone. But I can see the resolve in your eyes. That's good enough for me.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877938
    m_Localized: There you are, young one.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877939
    m_Localized: What shall we talk about today?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877940
    m_Localized: Back again, I see.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877941
    m_Localized: Seeing your face is becoming every bit as pleasant as minding the
      shop.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877942
    m_Localized: Good to see you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877943
    m_Localized: You have a moment to chat, don't you?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877944
    m_Localized: Ask about his request.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877945
    m_Localized: Everyday life
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877946
    m_Localized: The other rabbits
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877947
    m_Localized: The old days
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877948
    m_Localized: You're looking a little pale. Have you been getting enough sleep?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877949
    m_Localized: Business is important, but ruining your health for it is plain foolish.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877950
    m_Localized: I'm fine. Just a little tired...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877951
    m_Localized: When you're tired, don't force yourself. Get some rest. Close the
      shop once in a while and take a walk...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877952
    m_Localized: It pains an old rabbit to see someone so young do nothing but struggle.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877953
    m_Localized: They say the temperature will plunge tonight. I wonder if any drafts
      are getting through your shop walls.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877954
    m_Localized: If anything needs fixing, just say the word.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877955
    m_Localized: Would you fix it for me, Horong?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877956
    m_Localized: I'll take care of it myself.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877957
    m_Localized: I may not look it, but no one here swings a hammer better than I
      do. There isn't a house in this town I haven't worked on.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877958
    m_Localized: It's good that our young shopkeeper is capable, but... you ought
      to accept a helping paw now and then. Don't try to carry everything alone.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877959
    m_Localized: Tell me, are you eating proper meals while you work?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877960
    m_Localized: Running a shop alone makes it all too easy to skip meals, and a
      young rabbit can't work on an empty stomach.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877961
    m_Localized: I was going to eat later.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877962
    m_Localized: "Not later\u2014right now. When you were little... No, rabbits your
      age always put it off until they make themselves sick."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877963
    m_Localized: I won't sell you a thing until you go back to your shop and eat
      something.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877964
    m_Localized: You've been listening to Grandma Deunhae, haven't you? She may seem
      prickly on the outside, but no one cares for you more deeply.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877965
    m_Localized: She's such a gentle soul.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877966
    m_Localized: She does nag me quite a bit sometimes.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877967
    m_Localized: I'm truly glad you understand how she feels.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877968
    m_Localized: More than anyone, she wants to fill the empty place beside you with
      loving care. Trust her, and let yourself rely on her.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877969
    m_Localized: Ho ho, every word of that nagging is meant to do you good.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877970
    m_Localized: Besides, not everyone is lucky enough to have someone nag them so.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877971
    m_Localized: So, have you gotten to know the sisters, Nuri and Bori?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877972
    m_Localized: Nuri is a capable little thing, but Bori seems awfully shy.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877973
    m_Localized: Nuri is so adorable.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877974
    m_Localized: Bori helps me out a lot.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877975
    m_Localized: It puts my mind at ease to see you getting along with them.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877976
    m_Localized: Having friends your own age gives you more reasons to smile.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877977
    m_Localized: Little Nuri is especially fond of you. Look after her like a younger
      sister now and then, would you?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877978
    m_Localized: Bori is a deeply thoughtful child. She may be quiet, but when someone
      needs help, she's always the first to offer a paw.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877979
    m_Localized: If she's helping you like that, then she must have truly opened
      her heart to you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877980
    m_Localized: Did that Maru fellow push up his glasses and bombard you with more
      difficult talk? He's an odd one, but his mind is remarkably sharp.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877981
    m_Localized: Sometimes I have no idea what he's saying.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877982
    m_Localized: Ho ho, he can be like that, can't he? Still, not a word Maru says
      should be dismissed lightly.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877983
    m_Localized: One day, that rigid logic of his may be just the thing that keeps
      you safe.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877984
    m_Localized: "When you look into the tea shop oven... does it ever frighten you?
      Fire is a curious thing\u2014a blessing, yet terribly cruel at times."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877985
    m_Localized: Sometimes my chest feels tight.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877986
    m_Localized: Yes... I can understand that. But don't let the fear overwhelm you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877987
    m_Localized: You have good rabbits around you now. Even if the flames turn fierce
      again, you won't be alone this time.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877988
    m_Localized: When your shop becomes a grand success someday... who would you
      invite through its doors first?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877989
    m_Localized: My parents, though I don't remember them.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104318877990
    m_Localized: Your parents... Yes, if word of their young shopkeeper reached them
      somehow, I'm certain they would be overjoyed.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266304
    m_Localized: .....
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266305
    m_Localized: If... if there is some reason they cannot appear before you now,
      it isn't because they don't love you. It must be because they want to protect
      you. Someday... you will meet them. You have my word.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266306
    m_Localized: Ah, you remembered the favor I asked of you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266307
    m_Localized: Thanks to you, I finished the shop work with far less trouble.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266308
    m_Localized: I'm truly grateful. If you need anything next time, let this old
      shopkeeper lend a paw.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266309
    m_Localized: Have you seen the Moon Tree? It's faint, but its glow seems a little
      clearer than before. It feels as though a touch of warmth has returned to our
      darkened town.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266310
    m_Localized: When you've kept watch over one place as long as I have, you notice
      even the smallest changes. Everything had been so dim, so this is a welcome
      sight. Thanks to your hard work, the town seems to be breathing again.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266311
    m_Localized: You noticed it too, Horong.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266312
    m_Localized: The moon hardly has seasons, but... perhaps the cosmic currents
      have gone strange, because it's been terribly muggy lately. This old rabbit
      is sweating buckets trying to keep the shop's goods from spoiling.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266313
    m_Localized: The offer alone is kind enough, but I can manage this much. You
      take care not to exhaust yourself running your own shop.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266314
    m_Localized: Quite so. Life on the moon is always like this, but this year feels
      especially harsh. Mind your stock, of course, but your health comes first.
      Don't overdo it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266315
    m_Localized: That sounds exhausting. Can I help?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266316
    m_Localized: It really has been unusually hot lately.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266317
    m_Localized: Your shop has been open for a while now. Is business treating you
      well? I hope nothing has become too much to handle.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266318
    m_Localized: Good. Working hard while you're young is admirable, but don't suffer
      in silence. Remember that someone is always here, quietly cheering you on.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266319
    m_Localized: Good. Working hard while you're young is admirable, but don't suffer
      in silence. Remember that someone is always here, quietly cheering you on.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266320
    m_Localized: It's going well, thanks to everyone's help.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266321
    m_Localized: It's a little busy, but I'm enjoying it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266322
    m_Localized: A thought occurred to me. If I had a child of my own... more than
      anything, I would have supported whatever they truly wished to do with all
      my heart.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266323
    m_Localized: I would never want to burden them. Just seeing them smile brightly
      would have been more than enough.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266324
    m_Localized: Yes... Perhaps all I can do for someone is remain at a distance
      and quietly watch over them.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266325
    m_Localized: Yes... Perhaps all I can do for someone is remain at a distance
      and quietly watch over them.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266326
    m_Localized: You would have been such a kind father, Horong.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266327
    m_Localized: Any child of yours would have been very happy.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266328
    m_Localized: Who would have thought the Moon Tree could shine so brightly? The
      whole town is as radiant as day now, even at night, and a gentle warmth reaches
      inside my shop.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266329
    m_Localized: Indeed. After all those dark days, the sight is enough to clear
      an old rabbit's eyes. The town's newfound liveliness seems to have breathed
      new life into my shop as well. It warms my heart to see your hard work bear
      such radiant fruit.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266330
    m_Localized: The whole town feels completely different, doesn't it?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266331
    m_Localized: As life grew busier, everyone forgot the wishes and hopes they once
      held close. But I think I endured because, from this very spot, I never stopped
      hoping for a better tomorrow.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266332
    m_Localized: I did nothing remarkable. What matters is that each of us carries
      one small hope wherever we stand. You came along and rekindled that little
      flame.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266333
    m_Localized: The tree withered when the rabbits forgot how to dream, but you've
      shown us that when we join our hearts, it can shine again. Everyone in town
      will be grateful to you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266334
    m_Localized: The town never lost hope because of you, Horong.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266335
    m_Localized: Seeing the Moon Tree regain all its light... it moves even this
      old rabbit's heart. You brought light back to our dark moon town. You've done
      so very well.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266336
    m_Localized: What did I ever do? This is the fruit of your quiet perseverance.
      I'm truly proud of you. You've worked hard for such a long time.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266337
    m_Localized: Every drop of sweat you shed is shining before us now. I'll remember
      this magnificent sight for the rest of my days!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266338
    m_Localized: (Horong bows his head slightly and seems to wipe away a tear.)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266339
    m_Localized: I couldn't have done it without your warm advice.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266340
    m_Localized: Now that the town is bright again, I'll keep this shop as my home
      and watch over this place as I always have. My door will stay open whenever
      you need to catch your breath, so don't you worry. You just keep doing what
      you love.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266341
    m_Localized: That's right. A young rabbit should stride boldly forward. This
      old fellow will stand behind you and keep you steady. My last wish is for this
      shop to be a warm refuge where you can always rest. Come by anytime.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266342
    m_Localized: That's reassuring. Your shop has always been a source of strength
      for me.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266343
    m_Localized: Deunhae
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266344
    m_Localized: I've never seen the Moon Tree this quiet before.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266345
    m_Localized: The Starlight that once rested on every branch is fading. No wonder
      the whole village is worried.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266346
    m_Localized: Still, don't be too frightened, dear. Sometimes, even the smallest
      light can awaken a tree again.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266347
    m_Localized: "(\uD50C\uB808\uC774\uC5B4 \uC774\uB984), how have you been since
      opening the tea shop?"
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266348
    m_Localized: Welcoming unfamiliar guests and running the shop all by yourself
      cannot be easy.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266349
    m_Localized: Next time, tell Grandma what faces your guests make when they taste
      your sweets.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266350
    m_Localized: The air around the tree feels just a little warmer today.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266351
    m_Localized: Even if you cannot see it yet, it means the Starlight you gathered
      is reaching all the way down to its roots.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266352
    m_Localized: There is no need to rush. Let us keep going, one step at a time.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266353
    m_Localized: What sort of guests have been visiting your shop lately?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266354
    m_Localized: They all have different tastes and come from different places. I
      would love to see them gathered around your sweets.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266355
    m_Localized: If things ever become difficult, do not suffer in silence. Come
      and tell Grandma.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266356
    m_Localized: Look at the tip of that leaf. Do you see that faint glimmer that
      was not there before?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266357
    m_Localized: Even in its long slumber, the Moon Tree can feel how much care you
      have given it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266358
    m_Localized: The light is still fragile, so let us watch over it and make sure
      it does not go out.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266359
    m_Localized: A sweet aroma drifted all the way to the village entrance. Your
      shop must have been busy again today.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266360
    m_Localized: It is wonderful to have more guests, but looking after yourself
      is part of running a shop too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266361
    m_Localized: Rest when you grow tired. What matters most is having the heart
      to keep going for a long time.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266362
    m_Localized: Even these old eyes can see Starlight flowing along the trunk now.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266363
    m_Localized: The tree that had been cold ever since it lost its light is beginning
      to breathe again.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266364
    m_Localized: "(\uD50C\uB808\uC774\uC5B4 \uC774\uB984), this is all your doing."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266365
    m_Localized: The guests leaving your shop seem so much brighter these days.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266366
    m_Localized: You are showing everyone that a plate of sweets can fill more than
      the stomach. It can soothe the heart as well.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266367
    m_Localized: Your shop is growing warmer and kinder than anything Grandma ever
      taught you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266368
    m_Localized: The light spreading along the branches has grown quite clear.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266369
    m_Localized: Little by little, it looks as it did long ago, when Starlight fell
      like rain over the village.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266370
    m_Localized: Perhaps I will get to see that sight once more.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266371
    m_Localized: Compared with the first time you shaped dough, your hands have become
      so sure and skillful.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266372
    m_Localized: Even while learning new sweets, you never forgot to care for each
      and every guest.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266373
    m_Localized: That caring heart is what has restored so much of the Moon Tree's
      light. I am very proud of you, dear.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266374
    m_Localized: The leaves make such a clear, lovely sound whenever the wind blows.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266375
    m_Localized: The Moon Tree is clearly answering the Starlight now.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266376
    m_Localized: The village is regaining its old warmth as well. Your efforts were
      not in vain.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266377
    m_Localized: "(\uD50C\uB808\uC774\uC5B4 \uC774\uB984), I always knew you would
      run a fine shop, but you have done even better than Grandma imagined."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266378
    m_Localized: No matter how busy you became, you never put any less care into
      your sweets.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266379
    m_Localized: I am so proud to call you my apprentice.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266380
    m_Localized: At night, little fragments of Starlight now gather between the branches.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266381
    m_Localized: Once it regains just a little more strength, this tree will light
      the entire village again.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266382
    m_Localized: We have come this far because all the feelings you gathered finally
      reached the tree.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266383
    m_Localized: It feels like only yesterday that I taught you how to make sweets.
      Now you tend to more hearts than even Grandma does.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266384
    m_Localized: Both the shop and the Moon Tree are finding their way home beneath
      your gentle hands.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266385
    m_Localized: "You have done so wonderfully, (\uD50C\uB808\uC774\uC5B4 \uC774\uB984).
      I could not be prouder."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266386
    m_Localized: Can you see it? The Moon Tree has finally regained its light.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266387
    m_Localized: I feared I might never see it like this again, but you have put
      an end to Grandma's long years of worry.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266388
    m_Localized: "Thank you, (\uD50C\uB808\uC774\uC5B4 \uC774\uB984). Truly, thank
      you."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266389
    m_Localized: Your tea shop is no longer simply a place that sells sweets.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266390
    m_Localized: It has become a place where hearts from different stars can rest,
      and where those hearts brighten the Moon Tree and the village in return.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 104327266391
    m_Localized: You have carried on the story Grandma began so beautifully. I am
      very proud of you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  references:
    version: 2
    RefIds: []
